flowchart TD
    A([Start])
    --> B[Open Matching Criteria]
    --> C[Select employee attribute]
    --> D[Select operator and value]
    --> E{Add another criterion?}

    E -- Yes --> C
    E -- No --> F[Evaluate criteria against employees]
    --> G[Display matching employee count]
    --> H{Administrator saves?}

    H -- No --> I([Cancel])
    H -- Yes --> J[Save Matching Criteria]
    --> K([Pending synchronization])
